title: The Three Internationals
subtitle: Moscow, Vienna and London meet at one table in the Reichstag.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1922 and month = 4
max-visits: 1
priority: 2

= The Three Internationals

From 2 to 5 April the three Internationals meet in the Reichstag: the Second of Vandervelde and MacDonald, Friedrich Adler's Vienna Union, and ours, with Radek, Bukharin and Clara Zetkin. It is the first time since 1914 that they have sat at one table.

The social democrats have one condition. The Socialist Revolutionaries on trial in Moscow must have defence counsel of their choice and must not be sentenced to death. If our side agrees, there will be joint marches across Europe on 20 April, and in Berlin the German party will organise them.

- @promise: Give the guarantee, and march with the SPD.
- @expose: March with them, and attack their leaders from the platform.
- @away: Stay away from the marches.

@promise
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] A big day in the Lustgarten. The promise will have to be kept.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids marching with the social democrats.
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.e22) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.e22_lib.onArrival); }
RG.e22.against('united_front');
RG.ecci('radek', 5);
Q.e22_three_int = 1;
Q.spd_relation += 8;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
!}

Radek signs the guarantee on the last evening. On 20 April a hundred and fifty thousand march in the Lustgarten under red flags of every shade, and Zetkin and Crispien speak from the same lorry.

@expose
subtitle: Zinoviev's way of doing it. The SPD will not thank us.
view-if: offensive_gone = 0
on-arrival: {!
RG.ecci('zinoviev', 5);
Q.e22_three_int = 2;
Q.spd_relation -= 5;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
!}

Our speakers march beside the social democrats and denounce them from the platform. The SPD press calls it a trick.

@away
subtitle: The marches go on without us.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e22_three_int = 3;
Q.worker_support -= 3;
Q.ultraleft_satisfaction += 4;
!}

Our members watch the marches from the pavement.
